                    <span style="background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15); color: #a5b4fc; font-size: 0.72rem; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3); font-family: monospace; font-weight: 600;">Ctrl K</span>
